## 13. Risk Mitigation

*(Updated with new deployment model risks)*

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| **On-prem hardware failure** | AI Butler monitors hardware health; predicts failure; automated backup ensures zero data loss |
| **Cloud CDN dependency** | All models support air-gapped fallback; CDN is acceleration, not required |
| **AI Butler error** | All critical ops require human approval; AI Butler has no destructive autonomy |
| **Client IT staff turnover** | AI Butler is the institutional memory — every operation documented, no tribal knowledge |
| **SME customer churn** | Plug-and-play appliance; zero configuration; AI Butler handles everything |
| **Competition from cloud CMS** | Unique hardware + AI Butler combo not available from cloud-only vendors |

